    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Hardvér",
    "content": "Úvod Požiadavky Počítač s dostupným portom USB.\nSwing Catalyst 21.4 a platná licencia s podporou Duálnej Dosky Tlaku\nZačíname Use the QR code on the back of the welcome card you received with the plates or click here to register your plates. After registering, you get an email which you calibration file as an attachment, this file is needed to get started in Swing Catalyst.\nYou can also run a manual calibration of the dual pressure plate by downloading the calibration utility here and follow the guided steps to generate the calibration file.\nSave the .mxd file in a folder of your convenience and start Swing Catalyst.\nStart Swing Catalyst Open the Swing Catalyst software and register your license in “General settings” and “License Configuration”.\nIn settings, navigate to “Hardware” in the left margin. The Dual Pressure Plate should be automatically detected.\nPress “Configure” –\u003e “Stance sensor” –\u003e “Browse and Install” –\u003e locate and select the .mxd file you saved and click “Open”\nIf necessary, use the “Flip \u0026 Rotate Devices” tab to make sure that the pressure heat map reflects the golfer’s feet and center of pressure.\nPlacing the plates To get correct represenation of your pressure data, it is important to make sure that the plates are placed correct in relation to each other.\nMake sure that:\nThe cables are placed behind the golfer\nThat the plates are placed so you can read “Swing Catalyst” from the face on right camera angle\nUsing the custom stance width Different clubs require different stance widths. With our improved Pressure and Stance settings you can be sure to always record swings with the correct stance width.\nWith the protection mat as a foundation, you can choose to place the plates\nTogether - choose ‘Narrow’ in settings\nAt the outer edges of the mat - choose ‘Wide’ in settings\nCustom distance - measure the distance between the edges of the plates\nLast updated: 2024-09-03 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Použite QR kód na zadnej strane privítacej karty, ktorú ste dostali s doskami, alebo kliknite sem na registráciu vašich dosiek. Po registrácii dostanete e-mail...",
