    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Hardvér",
    "content": "Tento článok opisuje, ako používať launch monitor TrackMan, FlightScope alebo ForeSight na automatické spustenie záznamu pri údere do golfovej lopty. Ide o dobrú alternatívu k používaniu mikrofónu, keď je v oblasti veľa hluku, ako sú veterné podmienky alebo okolí golfisti na cvičnej ploche.\nVzťahuje sa na Swing Catalyst 4.5 a novšie verzie\nSúvisiace How to setup trigger microphone Solution Start Swing Catalyst and open Hardware settings from the settings menu\nMake sure you have connected your launch monitor device to the computer\nMake sure the the launch monitor software is running*\nUnder Launch Monitor check the Enabled box to start registering ball and **club data from the launch monitor\nCheck Use as trigger to automatically trigger video recordings when a shot is registered\nSwing Catalyst will now automatically trigger a video recording every time a shot is registered.\n** Foresight can be used without the Foresight simulator software running. Please see the corresponding support article for how to use Foresight with Swing Catalyst.*\n**Not all devices support club data (also depending on mode).\nMake sure launch monitor is enabled and used as a trigger.\nCertain launch monitors have more delay than others in processing data. This can be compensated for by selecting the “Configuration” drop down, and adding delay in milliseconds to compensate for.\nE.g. 1500 ms is a good value to try.\nLast updated: 2024-04-24 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Ako nakonfigurať Launch Monitor ako spúšť záznamu v nastaveniach hardvéru Swing Catalyst",
