    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Hardvér",
    "content": "Ako používať kodér NVIDIA GPU v aplikácii Swing Catalyst Tento článok podpory pokrýva, ako opraviť chyby kodéra NVIDIA GPU.\nPOZNÁMKA: Nie všetky NVIDIA GPU sú podporované.\nPOZNÁMKA: GPU AMD ATI nie sú podporované vôbec.\nNajprv sa uistite, že je GPU NVIDIA vybrané v nastaveniach Video \u0026 Capture v aplikácii Swing Catalyst. Ak máte viac ako 2 kamery, uistite sa, že ste povolili opravu v časti “Pokročilé nastavenia” v časti Kódovanie videa.\nGo into capture mode and record a swing, if the swing triggers but does not complete see instructions below. Step 1: Click your start button and search Windows for “Graphics setting”\nStep 2: Turn on “Reduce latency and improve performance”\nStep 3: Under the Choose an app to set preference section make sure it’s set to desktop app and click browse.\nStep 4: Navigate to C:\\Program Files\\Initial Force\\Swing Catalyst\\bin and highlight the MotionCatalyst.exe then click add.\nStep 5: Highlight the newly added Motion Catalyst and click “options” then select “High performance GPU: NVIDIA XXXX”\n**Possible backup solution for some laptops **\nStep 1: Right click on your desktop and go to “NVIDIA Control Panel”. If it’s not present then please download and install the most recent drivers and control panel here: https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/geforce/drivers/\nStep 2: In the control panel go to “Manage 3D settings” should be 2nd option from the top on the left hand side.\nStep 3: Click the “Preferred graphics processor” drop down and change it from “Integrated graphics” to “High-performance NVIDIA processor”\nStep 4: Click apply and close the control panel, open Swing Catalyst and capture another recording to see if its fixed. If not please email support@swingcatalyst.com\n*click to enlarge\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Tento článok podpory sa zaoberá tým, ako opraviť chyby NVIDIA GPU Encoder.",
