    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Hardvér",
    "content": "Úvod Tento podporný článok popisuje, ako môžete používať launch monitor FlightScope so Swing Catalyst. Swing Catalyst bude integrovať a ukladať všetky dáta FlightScope pri zázname nového zábeру. Aby ste umožnili integráciu, musí byť software FlightScope spustený súčasne so Swing Catalyst.\nVzťahuje sa na Používatelia s launch monitorom FlightScope. Podporované modely: Série X1, X2, X2 elite a X3.\nSérie Xi a Xi+.\nInštalácia Aby Swing Catalyst rozpoznal a prečítal údaje o zásahu z FlightScope, je potrebné aktivovať režim servera v softvéri FlightScope.\nSpustite FlightScope a kliknite na tlačidlo “Advanced Settings” v hlavnej ponuke. (V novších verziách FlightScope stačí stlačiť kláves ALT na klávesnici, aby sa zobrazil panel ponuky). Click the Advanced Settings button, located bottom right and a menu bar will show on the top of the screen. Click Networking, and select Server from the list. Verify that “Server Port” is set to 1248 and press Ok.\nNote: The server name and server IP address may vary depending on if you’re connected via USB X2 (Ethernet for X2 Elite) and or WiFi. It should not be necessary to change this.\nGo to Player Comparison or similar mode in FlightScope. Make sure FlightScope is tracking and displaying shots.\nStart Swing Catalyst and keep FlightScope running in the background.\nGo to the Swing Catalyst Main Menu - Settings - Hardware and tick off “Enabled” under Launch Monitor.\nIf it says disconnected, make sure the FlightScope application is running and that the FlightScope unit is connected to the PC or WiFi network.\nFlightScope should say, Server active, 1 clients. This means Swing Catalyst successfully has connected to the FlightScope.\nKnown Issues FlightScope is not shown as connected, even if FlightScope software is running and tracking shots and server mode is enabled.\nTry restarting FlightScope and Swing Catalyst. Start FlightScope first.\nTry setting server mode to None, then turn it back on again. See step 3.\nFlightScope is displayed on the wrong screen.\nTo move FlightScope to another screen: Click on the FlightScope program, and move the mouse cursor to the other monitor. While leaving the mouse cursor on the desired screen, click the F11 button. FlightScope should now be running on the other screen.\nLast updated: 2021-06-16 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Tento článok podpory opisuje, ako môžete používať launch monitor FlightScope so Swing Catalyst. Swing Catalyst bude integrovať a ukladať všetky...",
    "tags": [
      "Usb-Camera",
      "Launch-Monitor"
    ],
    "title": "Ako používať FlightScope so Swing Catalyst",
    "uri": "/sc-support/sk/hardware/flightscope-setup/index.html"
