    "breadcrumb": "Podpora Swing Catalyst \u003e Hardvér",
    "content": "Úvod Tento článok podpory popisuje, ako nastaviť Foresight GCQuad / GCHawk so Swing Catalyst. GCQuad funguje s FSX a Swing Catalyst súčasne.\nPožiadavky Počítač s voľným USB portom alebo WiFi (oddelené od internetového pripojenia).\nSwing Catalyst 8.0 alebo novší\nPoznámka: Ak chcete používať HD kamery so Swing Catalyst, odporúčame spúšťať FSX oddelene (t.j. nie súčasne so Swing Catalyst) alebo na inom počítači.\nUistite sa, že máte aspoň NVIDIA GeForce 1080 alebo lepšiu a že počítač primerane spĺňa odporúčania spoločnosti Foresight.\nInštalácia Pripojte GCQuad cez USB, WiFi* alebo Ethernet.\nV nastaveniach Swing Catalyst -\u003e Hardvér vyberte Foresight GCQuad.\nUistite sa, že Launch Monitor je ZAPNUTÝ a že je zaškrtnutá možnosť “Použiť ako trigger”.\n*** If connecting via Wi-Fi it’s important you have another means of internet connectivity as it must be validated through the internet in order to use the GCQuad.**\n***If GC Hawk isn’t importing club data make sure firmware is updated to latest version. **\n*Putting mode is not supported as a trigger in Swing Catalyst.\nTroubleshooting The Foresight GCQuad is not showing as connected or is not triggering Power cycle the Foresight GCQuad / GCHawk.\nMake sure that the Foresight GCQuad is showing up on your computer. It will show up as a Mass Storage Device under This PC.\nConnect the device to a different USB port on the computer if it doesn’t show up.\nIf connected through WiFi make sure you have access to the internet through other means, or have a separate WiFi dongle. The connection to the GCQuad must be dedicated.\nMake sure the GCQuad LED is green, not blue. If it is blue the club tracking is turned off. Club tracking must be on for it to work. See Foresight GCQuad manual for more information: https://www.foresightsports.com/sites/default/files/files/GCQuad_User_Manual.pdf\nRestart Swing Catalyst.\nRestart the computer.\nIf you tried all these steps and it still shows as not connected in Swing Catalyst, please contact support@swingcatalyst.com.\nLast updated: 2022-06-23 | View on official support site",
    "description": "Tento článok podpory opisuje, ako nastaviť Foresight GCQuad / GCHawk so Swing Catalyst. GCQuad funguje s FSX a Swing Catalyst súčasne.",
