    "content": "Použitie grafu viacerých síl Tento článok sa zaoberá funkčnosťou dostupnou vo verzii 10.0 a vyššej.\nPoužiteľné varianty softvéru: Motion Catalyst \u0026 Swing Catalyst.\nVerzie: 10.0 - 10.2\nDostupné len pre rozloženia Data-Centric a Detailed Data.\nPožadovaný hardvér: Silomerná doska(y) / Motion Plate / Dual Motion Plate alebo záznam s údajmi o sile.\nWhich version of the software am I using?\nRelated articles:\nUsing the new graph library\nForce graph phases\nMultiple Forces Graph Databox The multiple forces graph databox is a databox that has new some new functionality.\nIt still behaves the same as existing graphs, you can interact with the graphs the same way (see article above, “Using the new graph library” for details.\nNoticeable features are:\nCombined data view, all force data in one databox.\nValue annotation when clicking the graph, annotation follows the mouse cursor.\nAbility to toggle the visibility for each source.\nYour source selection is remembered individually for both the Data Centric and Detailed Data layouts respectively.\nSupports phase highlighting.\nExample of the multiple forces databox in the Detailed Data layout\nExample from the Data Centric Layout:\nNote some sources are de-selected. The visibility can easily be changed by toggling it from the menu highlighted by the red arrow.\nSources that are turned off will have a muted color compared to those that are enabled.\nValue annotation Clicking each graph will show an annotation of the value at the position of the mouse cursor.\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
